. trainReturn is the arithmetic mean of overlapping expanding-training fold returns, never their sum.","Decisions use close t and only 4H candles closed by t; entries and signal exits use open t+1. Fee 10 bps plus adverse slippage 5 bps on each side. One unlevered position, all available cash, fractional quantities; exchange lot/tick rounding and capacity are not modeled.","Known opening stop/target events resolve before later intrabar extremes. Otherwise stop-first for ambiguous OHLC; gap-through stops use the worse open, while favorable target gaps fill at the fixed target. No target fill on an entry bar. Stops remain active. Maximum hold 72 hours; predeclared fold boundaries flatten at the final bar open with both exit costs.","Drawdown uses hourly equity including estimated liquidation costs, not an intrabar worst-case path. No fees for idle cash, funding, shorting, leverage, tax or liquidity impact beyond fixed slippage.","Degradation and low-sample flags are descriptive; these short, single-symbol folds do not prove robustness, eliminate overfitting, or estimate a probability of future profit.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 1: training 2026-09-18T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-05T11:59:59.999Z, 19 trades, -2.656%; test 2026-10-05T12:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-11T00:59:59.999Z, 6 trades, -3.751% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 2: training 2026-09-18T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-11T00:59:59.999Z, 24 trades, -5.918%; test 2026-10-11T01:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-16T13:59:59.999Z, 6 trades, -3.204% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 3: training 2026-09-18T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-16T13:59:59.999Z, 30 trades, -9.117%; test 2026-10-16T14:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-22T03:59:59.999Z, 6 trades, -2.417% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum: low sample (18 out-of-sample trades; warning threshold 30).","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 1: training 2026-09-18T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-05T11:59:59.999Z, 3 trades, -0.841%; test 2026-10-05T12:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-11T00:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% n